 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use the figure shown to answer the questions.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/161b1cb488480312.png\" alt=\"Two graphs. Graph H has 7 vertices: a to g. The edges are a b, a e, b d, e d, d c, d f, f g, and c g. Graph Q has 7 vertices: h to n. The edges are h i, h j, I j, I k, k m, m n, m l, k l, and n l.\">\n",
